  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Air Quality Mgnt, phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Luftkvalitet fas 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r en avslutande fas av ett st&#xf6;rre luftmilj&#xf6;projekt (start 1994) i Tallinn. Den sista delen &#xe4;mnar f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra och utveckla den tekniska bas som &#xe4;r installerad samt h&#xf6;ja den personalkompetensen inom organisationen vad g&#xe4;ller utnyttjandet av den information som datasystemet kan producera.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a final phase of a project initiated in 1994, aiming at improving the capability at the Tallinn Environment Department to handle general as well as specific tasks in regard to air quality in Tallinn. This part aims at enhancing the functions of the monitoring network and the info. system so as to produce reports on air quality.</narrative>
  </description>
